# The full site is live by default. Set to "false" to bring back the coming soon page at /
# (inner pages are then hidden from search engines and the sitemap).
NEXT_PUBLIC_LAUNCHED=true

# Contact form: the Formspree form ID is built in (xnpparbe, see lib/site.ts). Only set this to
# use a different form, or to "off" to make the form open the visitor's mail app instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
